 673+ 607B                  ; Calcola ColStart (E) e ColEnd (C) per uno sprite largo 8 pixel (X .. X+7)
 674+ 607B 79               ld   a, c
 675+ 607C CB 3F            srl  a
 675+ 607E CB 3F          srl a
 675+ 6080 CB 3F          srl a
