1218+ 7A4A C6 07            add  a, 7
1219+ 7A4C 47               ld   b, a
1220+ 7A4D CD 12 7A         call CheckWallCell
1221+ 7A50 38 0E            jr   c, .collision
1222+ 7A52
1223+ 7A52                  ; 3. Punto inferiore: (X, Y + 15)
1224+ 7A52 C1               pop  bc
1225+ 7A53 C5               push bc
1226+ 7A54 78               ld   a, b
1227+ 7A55 C6 0F            add  a, 15
1228+ 7A57 47               ld   b, a
1229+ 7A58 CD 12 7A         call CheckWallCell
1230+ 7A5B 38 03            jr   c, .collision
1231+ 7A5D
1232+ 7A5D C1               pop  bc
1233+ 7A5E B7               or   a                 ; Reset carry (nessuna collisione)
1234+ 7A5F C9               ret
